# promise: #607
# A link clicked in another app opens a Little Window and leaves the browser window where it was: behind that
# app's windows (#607). A link brings Cra forward before it arrives, and AppKit raised the browser window (the main
# window then) over the app the link came from, on its own display, as the Little Window came up on another one.
# `cover` is that app, with a window over the browser window; over=<n> counts other apps' windows still over it
# (0 without the fix). The Little Window opens on the main display and the browser window on the test display
# (CRA_TEST_SCREEN; the nightly's virtual one), as with the pointer on another display.
budget rss=700 stalls50=20
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "defaultLinkDestination": {"littleWindow": {}}}
env CRA_TEST_LITTLE_SCREEN=main
pace 0.5

cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=main
wait 2
# The browser window was in use (key) before another app came over it.
cra://debug?activate=1
wait 1
cover
cra://debug?yieldTo=${COVER}
wait 1

# A link clicked in that app: it brings Cra forward, then the link arrives.
cover link
cra://debug?externalURL=${PAGE}?n=little
wait 2
cra://debug?littleShown=first
expect-log little shown first: windows=1 .* behind=0 over=[1-9]
